div.p:
The following classes are not called upon for such service: Ministers of state;
                    members of the senates of the free Hanse cities; those officials of the empire
                    who are at all times subject to temporary retirement; state officials who, by
                    the laws of the particular states, are subject to such retirement; judicial
                    officers and state-attorneys and other officials in the offices of the latter;
                    officials who execute judicial arid police process; servants of the church;
                    teachers in public schools; military persons belonging to the active army and
                    navy.
